<title>GREECE: GREEK NAVY TO RAISE FLAG ON NEW 'SPETSES' FRIGATE.</title>
<headline>GREEK NAVY TO RAISE FLAG ON NEW 'SPETSES' FRIGATE.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Greek flag will be raised on the navy's new frigate called Spetses on Thursday, October 24 at 1130 local at the Skaramanga shipyards, the navy general headquarters said in a statement.</p>
<p>--Dimitris Kontogiannis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
